# BricsBot: retain the runtime assets used by Stonefish/RViz in Git.
# Raw CAD, conversion intermediates and retired assets are kept locally in
# archive/ and must not be committed.  This intentionally does NOT ignore:
#   bricsbot_stonefish_baked.{obj,mtl}, bricsbot.png,
#   bricsbot_collision_candidate.{obj,mtl}, bricsbot.urdf,
#   bot_shark_stonefish.{obj,mtl}, TAG.png
/src/aquaflow_stonefish/data/bricsbot/archive/
/src/aquaflow_stonefish/data/bricsbot/*.blend
/src/aquaflow_stonefish/data/bricsbot/*.blend1
/src/aquaflow_stonefish/data/bricsbot/*.bak
